<title>JAPAN: Uehara Sei - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Uehara Sei - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 38.51		vs	   37.66</p>
<p> Operating	  468    million	  vs	  428    million</p>
<p> Current	    740    million	  vs	  696    million</p>
<p> Net		  453    million	  vs	  410    million</p>
<p> EPS		   18.69 yen	  vs	   16.91 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     24 million	  vs	  24 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Uehara Sei Shoji Co Ltd is a wholesaler-retailer of petroleum, liquefied petroleum gas, cement and ready-mixed concrete.</p>
